  "project_description": "Extra Block Types: Stats module provides ability to add Numbers with Text/Icons, Description and Title with WYSIWYG editor. It ships an 'EBT Stats' block content type whose repeatable stat items (number, text, optional link and image) are stored as 'EBT Stats Item' paragraphs, and offers three predefined layouts: stats with vertical dividers, stats in squares, and stats in a column. Part of the Extra Block Types (EBT) family built on top of EBT Core; blocks are intended for placement in Layout Builder.",
